    "skyPreset": "golden_alpine_meadow",
    "loreSummary": "Three roads meet at Shalegill's eastern village and nowhere else on Stonemoor do more than two, so this is where the road in from the far head joins the road down to the port. Parties stop for the two things a carrying party runs out of first: sweet water standing in a flooded shaft at a depth a bucket can reach, and rock worth breaking while they wait for the road ahead to clear."
